# TaskFlow – AI Powered Collaborative Task Management Platform

TaskFlow is a modern collaborative productivity and project management platform built for teams to manage projects, tasks, workflows, deadlines, and team collaboration in one centralized workspace.

The platform combines:
- project management
- team collaboration
- task tracking
- productivity monitoring
- workspace organization

inside a premium futuristic dashboard experience inspired by Linear, Notion, and modern SaaS applications.

