# Features

## Authentication
- JWT-based authentication
- Login & Register
- Persistent sessions
- Protected routes
- Logout functionality

## Dashboard
- Active tasks overview
- Completed tasks
- Overdue tracking
- In-review tasks
- Productivity insights
- Recent activity feed
- Favorite projects
- Upcoming deadlines

## Project Management
- Create projects
- Edit/Delete projects
- Favorite projects
- Recent projects
- Dedicated project workspace
- Team member management

## Task Management
- Create/Edit/Delete tasks
- Kanban task board
- Task assignment
- Priority labels
- Status tracking
- Due dates
- Overdue tasks
- Upcoming deadlines

## Team Collaboration
- Project-based team dashboard
- Active collaborators
- Member roles
- Workload indicators
- Team activity tracking
- Google Meet integration

## UI/UX
- Futuristic dashboard design
- Glassmorphism UI
- Responsive layouts
- Dark/Light themes
- Smooth animations

---

# Tech Stack

## Frontend
- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion

## Backend
- FastAPI
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt Password Hashing

## Database
- Supabase PostgreSQL

---

# Database Tables

The project uses the following tables:

- users
- projects
- project_members
- tasks
- activities
- notifications

